  "extractionNotes": "Full-time employee (title from 2020-05-25, full time from 2022-05-25; registered unemployed without benefit before that). Continuation claim for sickness benefit in pregnancy 2024-01-19..2024-02-03 (an earlier sick period was paid before; not in the file), then maternity + parental leave for 52 weeks from 2024-02-04. Two maternity Z-3s: the first (application date 2024-02-20) gives the maternity part only, the corrected one covers 2024-02-04..2025-02-01 with the remark maternity 2024-02-04..2024-06-22 and parental 2024-06-23..2025-02-01 (ZUS benefit codes 311/319). Application within 21 days of the birth, so 81.5% inferred. ZUS register: title 1240 2024-02-04..2025-02-01 and monthly 319 payments up to 2025-02-01; typed note: sickness in pregnancy and maternity benefit established and paid. Birth date redacted on the extract; taken as the first maternity day. Salary tables are blank (already supplied earlier), so no months. Sick-note code not legible; pregnancy code B inferred. Employer reported up to 20 insured (ZUS pays). Father's statement attached by the claimant (its dates not legible)."
